<title>UK: Telecom Argentina sets 400 bln lire 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Telecom Argentina sets 400 bln lire 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banca Commerciale Italiana and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TELECOM ARGENTINA - FRANCE TELECOM SA</p>
<p> AMT    400 BLN LIRE  COUPON     8.875     MATURITY    30.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.73    PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.33     SPREAD	+160 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BBB-	DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.50	SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING 10-YEAR SWAPS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
